  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create an <a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> backed by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个由给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 支持的 <a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0, use <a href=\"#getBeanFactory()\"><code>getBeanFactory()</code></a> and interact with the bean factory directly.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，请使用<a href=\"#getBeanFactory()\"><code>getBeanFactory()</code></a>并直接与 BeanFactory 交互。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0 as this isn't widely used and can be easily implemented within user code.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，由于该功能使用不广泛且易于在用户代码中实现。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Unset properties are considered being true.",
      "translation": "未设置的属性被视为为真。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a reference to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a> backing this <a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个引用，指向支持此<a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"../util/TypeScanner.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeScanner</code></a> used to scan for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> that will be contributed to the AOT\nprocessing infrastructure.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的<a href=\"../util/TypeScanner.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeScanner</code></a>，用于扫描将贡献给 AOT 处理基础设施的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> to customize the AOT processing for the\ngiven type.",
      "translation": "获取给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> 的 <a href=\"AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a>，以自定义给定类型的 AOT 处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> to customize the AOT processing for the\ngiven type. Repeated calls to the same type will result in merging the configuration.",
      "translation": "获取给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ResolvableType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>ResolvableType</code></a> 的 <a href=\"AotTypeConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotTypeConfiguration</code></a>，以自定义该类型的 AOT 处理。对同一类型重复调用将合并配置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0, use <a href=\"#getTypeScanner()\"><code>getTypeScanner()</code></a> directly",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，请直接使用<a href=\"#getTypeScanner()\"><code>getTypeScanner()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks if repository code generation is enabled for a given module by checking environment variables for general\nenablement (<a href=\"#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED\"><code>GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED</code></a>) and store-specific ones following the pattern\nspring.aot.&amp;lt;module-name&amp;gt;.repositories.enabled.",
      "translation": "检查是否已为给定模块启用仓库代码生成，方法是检查环境变量以确认总体启用状态（<a href=\"#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED\"><code>GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_ENABLED</code></a>），以及遵循模式 spring.aot.&amp;lt;module-name&amp;gt;.repositories.enabled 的特定于存储库的变量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks if repository metadata file writing is enabled by checking environment variables for general enablement\n(<a href=\"#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED\"><code>GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED</code></a>)",
      "translation": "检查是否启用了仓库元数据文件写入功能，通过检查环境变量中的通用启用状态（<a href=\"#GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED\"><code>GENERATED_REPOSITORIES_JSON_ENABLED</code></a>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"AotContext.IntrospectedBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext.IntrospectedBeanDefinition</code></a> to obtain further detail about the underlying bean definition. An\nintrospected bean definition can also point to an absent bean definition.",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a href=\"AotContext.IntrospectedBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext.IntrospectedBeanDefinition</code></a> 以获取有关底层 Bean 定义的更多详细信息。一个经过内省的 Bean 定义也可以指向一个不存在的 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>AotContext</code> builder.",
      "translation": "创建一个 `<code>AotContext`</code> 构建器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by this <a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此<a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotContext</code></a>所使用的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>用于解析<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>types</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - reference to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 的引用；不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "a new instance of <a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个<a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotContext</code></a>的新实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>configurationConsumer</code> - configuration consumer function.",
      "translation": "<code>configurationConsumer</code> - 配置消费者函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the introspected bean definition.",
      "translation": "内省后的 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
