      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used by this <a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext</code></a> to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回此<a href=\"AotContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.aot 中的接口\"><code>AotContext</code></a>用于解析<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>types</code></a>所需的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Scans for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named packages</code></a> annotated with the store-specific\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>identifying annotations</code></a>.",
      "translation": "扫描给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named packages</code></a> 中带有特定存储区专用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>identifying annotations</code></a> 注解的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"AotContext.TypeIntrospector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext.TypeIntrospector</code></a> to obtain further detail about a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> given its fully-qualified\ntype name",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a href=\"AotContext.TypeIntrospector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.aot\"><code>AotContext.TypeIntrospector</code></a>，用于根据完全限定类型名称获取有关 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> 的更多详细信息。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Contribute type configurations to the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aot/generate/GenerationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GenerationContext</code></a>. This method is called once per\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aot/generate/GenerationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GenerationContext</code></a> after all type configurations have been registered.",
      "translation": "向给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aot/generate/GenerationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GenerationContext</code></a> 贡献类型配置。此方法在所有类型配置注册完成后，针对每个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aot/generate/GenerationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GenerationContext</code></a> 调用一次。",
      "count": 1
    },
